{"code":"025530","name":"SJM홀딩스","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1975년 설립, 1997년 유가증권시장 상장 후 2010년 제조사업부를 (주)에스제이엠으로 이전하고 지주회사로 전환함. 현재 20개 종속회사를 보유하며, 주요 자회사로 상장사 (주)에스제이엠과 비상장사 에이커스 등이 있음. 주요 사업은 자동차 배기계용 Flexible Coupling 제조, 건축·플랜트용 Expansion Joint 생산, 통신용 반도체 MMIC 분야임.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":3590.0,"open":3590.0,"high":3605.0,"low":3480.0,"volume":8092,"amount":29050280.0,"ret_1d":-0.1391,"gap":-0.1391,"range_pct":3.4819,"ret_5":1.2694,"ret_20":-1.7784,"ret_60":6.3704,"ret_120":-7.4742,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":3589.0,"ma60":3585.6667,"ma120":3564.0833,"ma200":3608.675,"close_vs_ma200":-0.5175,"close_vs_ma60":0.1209,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":9.7931,"r2_60":0.1323,"slope_120":0.5664,"r2_120":0.0007,"slope_250":-6.5949,"r2_250":0.305,"high52":4005.0,"low52":3180.0,"pos_52w":49.697,"dd_52w":-10.362,"mdd_1y":-17.0455,"atr14_pct":3.4322,"vol_ann_60":19.7067,"vol_avg20":8056.45,"vol_ratio20":1.0044,"vr5":0.9872,"vr20":0.5445,"amount_avg5":29176363.0,"amount_avg20":28796561.0,"amount_avg60":29391576.8333,"obv_chg20":-18.8787,"turnover_20":1.0789,"pv_eff_20":-1.6483,"rsi14":50.4547,"frgn_net_5":3518.0,"inst_net_5":-130.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0236,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0009,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0227,"frgn_net_20":1682.0,"inst_net_20":5341.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0113,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0358,"smart_net_20_pct":0.047,"frgn_net_60":9703.0,"inst_net_60":5765.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.065,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0386,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1036,"frgn_net_120":100449.0,"inst_net_120":4419.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.6726,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0296,"smart_net_120_pct":0.7022,"foreign_ratio":2.01,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.08,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":49.0,"op_margin_q":9.1418,"op_qoq":53.125,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":8.8889,"rev_yoy":7.6305,"op_trend_4q":31.4754,"fin_period":"202606","roe":9.2,"debt_ratio":21.54,"per":3.33,"pbr":0.26,"div_yield":6.96,"foreign_ra